        "original_id": "ce46c370-642b-5234-8e99-28df7f302a72",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jonathan Spector, Art Spector\n- Organizations: Charlton Athletic, West Ham United F.C.\n- Places: London Stadium\n- Topics: football transfers, loan spells, stadium relocation, family relationships\n\nFacts:\n- Jonathan Spector played on loan at Charlton Athletic before joining West Ham United in 2006.\n- Jonathan Spector played over 100 games for West Ham United before the club released him at the end of the 2010–11 season.\n- West Ham United F.C. relocated to the London Stadium in 2016.\n- Art Spector was the grandfather of American soccer player Jonathan Spector.",
